msgctxt "80"
msgid "(Those punks went down easier than swatting flies. Now to go help Date-san!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Tsukishima! Get your filthy hands off Mama!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"So you finally remembered, eh? You have any idea\r\n"
"how hard it was to track your retired ass down?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Let her go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I really was surprised, you know... I go looking for the bar\r\n"
"where you hang out, and who do I find? The same woman\r\n"
"I took hostage all those years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"So I figured I'd have some fun with the girl that got away\r\n"
"while we settled our score."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "(Date-san... I'll draw his attention. You finish the job!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Stay right where you are! I've got a couple friends I'd like\r\n"
"you to meet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Boys, take care of these two! Just make sure you leave\r\n"
"Date alive. I want to savor his final moments... in agony."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "What do you plan to do with Mama!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Ah, that's right. What to do with the lady... Oh, I have a thought. Why "
"don't I be a gentleman... and take her somewhere special? I guarantee it'll "
"bring back memories!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "So long, Date! We'll be waiting... that is, if you make it out in one piece!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Date-san! You go after Tsukishima, and I'll clean up here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Good looking out, Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"All right then. I'm not playing around, so if you don't want to get hurt... "
"this is your last chance to back down!"
msgstr ""

